meta {
  name: Search Modpacks
  type: http
  seq: 1
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/modpacks/search
  auth: none
}

params:query {
  query: adventure
  mcVersion: 1.21.1
}

docs {
  Search Modrinth modpacks. `query` is required - an empty query returns an empty array. `mcVersion` is optional and filters to packs for that Minecraft version. Results include id, slug, name, author, iconUrl, downloads, gameVersions and loader.
}
